Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, sed, grep
Recommends: openssh-server, ufw, fail2ban, docker.io
Description: Automated Ubuntu server hardening and Docker rootless setup
 A modular toolset for bootstrapping fresh Ubuntu servers with security
 hardening and Docker in rootless mode. Includes SSH hardening, UFW firewall
 configuration, fail2ban, kernel sysctl tuning, unattended upgrades, and
 Docker Engine installation in rootless mode.
